## 🧪 How This Helps

- The `xN.bin` files are now structured to enter `freerdp_is_valid_mcs_create_response()`.
- We embed ASN.1 certs that mimic real X.509 sequences and include policy OIDs.
- Both corruption & curveball candidates are sent to target `freerdp_certificate_policies()`.
- This function contains `OBJ_obj2txt(...)` which has had known parsing issues when input is malformed.

